question of it all my man.

00:00:09.416 --> 00:00:13.575
I mean, if you want to be
respected and and really known--

00:00:13.575 --> 00:00:17.015
- [Man] Show up.
- show the fuck up.

00:00:17.015 --> 00:00:19.404
I don't know how much into my
content you are but I always

00:00:19.404 --> 00:00:24.083
