there without the hard work.

00:00:24.083 --> 00:00:25.973
It's just real.

00:00:25.973 --> 00:00:28.683
Do you know how insane DailyVee
and the Snapchat stories has

00:00:28.683 --> 00:00:29.963
been to everybody?

00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:32.222
They didn't realize how
hard I was going at it.

00:00:32.222 --> 00:00:35.562
You can't believe how many, you
can't believe how many people,

00:00:35.562 --> 00:00:38.723
you know how many fuckin'
people used to say the word luck.

00:00:38.723 --> 00:00:41.852
That word luck has
gone right back.

00:00:41.852 --> 00:00:45.852
